# Keep secrets, local data and build output out of every image build.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
.data
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/server/src/generated
brand
website
# The web app, built into the server image, uses the mark and the fonts.
!brand/opificia-mark.svg
!brand/opificia-mark-reverse.svg
!website/fonts/*.woff2
